  "details": "In very dark worlds, Vive users get  a much darker experience. I have had it so that I can navigate fine on Oculus, and my friend using a Vive was unable to see anything at all.\nThe Vive's gamma/brightness is correct I think, because on Oculus you can see bad color banding on near-black textures.\n\nI don't know if this is an issue with VRChat or the Oculus screen/drivers, but as someone who likes dark worlds it's disappointing to know that it's not what it should be.\n\nI've left a version of the world I'm working on here for testing:\nwrld_cae506df-fcc0-4009-ac37-d0ce956446c8\n(there are light items in the room on the left when you go through the front door)",
